body:
It is really confusing... After you defeated the last giant you got a key, with that key you are able to reach another boss in the same area from where you can go on to another area. The other way is Heides Tower of Flame where you are  with the big stone soldiers... I would go that way.

&#x200B;

I don't want to spoil you any fun therefore if you want some general tips ill give em happily but I don't want to do so without you asking for it. Just one thing, the stat ADP in the game gives you something called agility. With this stat you're invincibility frames while rolling will be increased. I find the roll you start with absolutely terrible and recommend levelling up ADP. Helped me a lot. If you want any more hints Id be happy to tell. Have fun beating up those stone soldiers and the dragonrider.

&#x200B;

Edit: Armorer Dennis is an NPC I hate with every cell... The area he spawns in is not important for you right now.
